WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.701
-Today is Friday.

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:02.835
That's usually when I catch up

00:00:02.835 --> 00:00:04.136
on some personal stuff.

00:00:04.136 --> 00:00:05.338
I check my inbox.

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:07.140
I return some emails
and, of course,

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:08.341
I send out thank-you notes.

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:09.808
[ Cheering and applause ]
And I was just

00:00:09.808 --> 00:00:11.343
running a bit behind,

00:00:11.343 --> 00:00:12.779
so I thought,
if you guys wouldn't mind,

00:00:12.779 --> 00:00:14.881
I'd like to write out my weekly
thank-you notes right now.

00:00:14.881 --> 00:00:15.982
Is that alright with you guys?

00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:19.152
[ Cheering and applause ]
Thank you.

00:00:19.152 --> 00:00:22.088
James, can I get some thank-you
note writing music, please?

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:25.624
[ Playing tender tune ]
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.624 --> 00:00:27.126
-Tireless fighter.
-Yeah.

00:00:27.126 --> 00:00:29.662
♪♪

00:00:29.662 --> 00:00:32.131
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.131 --> 00:00:34.167
♪♪
[ Laughter ]
Thank you,

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:37.270
A$AP Rocky's cape
at the Met Gala,

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:38.972
for finally answering
the question,

00:00:38.972 --> 00:00:40.739
"What if you could wear
Crunch Berries?"

00:00:40.739 --> 00:00:46.612
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:46.612 --> 00:00:47.847
-Wahoo.

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:49.348
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.348 --> 00:00:52.952
-Thank you, people who wear
their masks around their elbows,

00:00:52.952 --> 00:00:54.754
for telling the world
that you're responsible,

00:00:54.754 --> 00:00:56.321
but also like pretty chill.

00:00:56.321 --> 00:01:00.693
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:00.693 --> 00:01:02.495
-"Anh, I'll put it on
if I need it."

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:03.929
-"Whatev."
-"Whatev."

00:01:03.929 --> 00:01:06.566
Oh, mask?
Okay.

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:07.900
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:11.304
-Thank you, tandem sky diving,
or as I like to call you,

00:01:11.304 --> 00:01:12.805
ultimate baby bjorning.

00:01:12.805 --> 00:01:15.775
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:17.243
"Let's do this!"

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:19.579
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.645 --> 00:01:21.046
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.046 --> 00:01:24.049
-Thank you,
Marriott and Hilton Hotels,

00:01:24.049 --> 00:01:26.853
for guaranteeing that,
whatever room you book,

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:29.288
you get a breathtaking view
of the parking lot.

00:01:29.288 --> 00:01:30.890
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:35.962
[ Cheering ]

00:01:35.962 --> 00:01:37.129
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.129 --> 00:01:38.865
Thank you, "The Price Is Right"

00:01:38.865 --> 00:01:40.799
celebrating its 50th season,

00:01:40.799 --> 00:01:43.135
for showing us that,
even after five decades,

00:01:43.135 --> 00:01:45.705
no one in America really knows
how much things cost.

00:01:45.705 --> 00:01:49.909
[ Laughter and applause ]
I don't know, $1.50?

00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:51.377
[ Applause ]

00:01:51.377 --> 00:01:53.346
-$10,000.
I don't know.

00:01:53.346 --> 00:01:55.047
-$10,001?

00:01:55.047 --> 00:01:56.515
[ Laughter ]
Okay.

00:01:56.515 --> 00:01:57.850
-You can't assume.
-Now they're hacking the system.

00:01:57.850 --> 00:02:00.219
Come on.

00:02:00.219 --> 00:02:01.521
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.521 --> 00:02:02.688
Alright, here's the last one.
Here we go.

00:02:02.688 --> 00:02:03.722
-Of what?
-Let me see.

00:02:03.722 --> 00:02:04.757
-Oh, thank-you notes.

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:05.758
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.758 --> 00:02:06.960
Just riff one, man.

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:08.928
Just go wild.
-Just riff a thank-you note?

00:02:08.928 --> 00:02:10.062
-Just riff
a thank-you note.

00:02:10.062 --> 00:02:13.466
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:13.466 --> 00:02:17.269
[ Suspenseful music plays ]

00:02:17.269 --> 00:02:18.938 line:0%
♪♪
[ Tapping ]
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.938 --> 00:02:26.246 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:26.246 --> 00:02:27.713
-Got one? Got it?
-Yeah.

00:02:27.713 --> 00:02:29.148
This one is about space.

00:02:29.148 --> 00:02:30.449
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.449 --> 00:02:33.352
I'll riff one.
-Okay. Alright.

00:02:33.352 --> 00:02:34.821
[ Tender tune plays ]

00:02:34.821 --> 00:02:35.855
-Thank ye --

00:02:35.855 --> 00:02:36.922
-[Both] "Thank ye."

00:02:36.922 --> 00:02:39.292
[ Laughter and applause ]
[ Rimshot ]

00:02:39.292 --> 00:02:40.526
[ Ding ]
-Oh, with an "E," yes.

00:02:40.526 --> 00:02:41.527
-Not bad.
-Yeah.

00:02:41.527 --> 00:02:42.795
-Hear ye, hear ye.

00:02:42.795 --> 00:02:44.030
Thank ye, thank ye.

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:45.464
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.464 --> 00:02:47.367
♪♪

00:02:47.367 --> 00:02:49.369
-Thank you,

00:02:49.369 --> 00:02:51.737
Nicki Minaj's cousin's friend --

00:02:51.737 --> 00:02:54.206
[ Laughter and applause ]
♪♪

00:02:54.206 --> 00:02:55.708
♪♪

00:02:55.708 --> 00:02:57.310
Sorry to leave you hanging.

00:02:57.310 --> 00:02:58.678
[ Laughter ]
There you go, everybody.

00:02:58.678 --> 00:02:59.946
Those are my thank you notes.

